<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25824" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διασκάπτω</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		3pl.
		fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-σκάψοντι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Tab.Heracl.</u>
					1.131
				</span></i>
			:—<i>dig through,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσθμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paus.
					2.1.5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τὰ τείχη</span>
			<i>make a breach in</i> them, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				13.14
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥόως τῷ ὕδατι</span>
			<i>make a breach</i> for water <i>in</i> the canals,
				<u>Tab.Heracl.</u> l. c., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				98.27
			</span></i>: also c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ τείχους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pyrrh.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			; <i>excavate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάφον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Charito
					8.7
				</span></i>
			.</div>
